#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:5
msgid "How to Avoid WhatsApp and Instagram Account Takeover – HSBC HK"
msgstr "提防WhatsApp騙案Instagram騙案 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:11
msgid "How to avoid WhatsApp and Instagram account takeover"
msgstr "如何避免WhatsApp和Instagram帳戶被盜用"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:19
msgid ""
"WhatsApp hackers can access your account without you knowing and use it "
"to send payment requests to your contacts. Those who receive the message "
"might believe it came from you and be likely to follow the instructions. "
"This tactic has spread to Instagram and other platforms with in-app "
"chats. Stay cautious on all messaging and social networking platforms to "
"avoid scams."
msgstr "騙徒在您不知情的情況下騎劫您的WhatsApp帳戶，然後向在您通訊錄上的親友發出轉賬請求，收到訊息的親友因誤信您有財務需要，繼而被騙去金錢"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:23
msgid "How fraudsters can hijack your account"
msgstr "騙徒騎劫帳戶手法"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:25
msgid ""
"Fraudsters may send messages claiming your account is at risk or has "
"violated user agreements, luring you to click a fake customer service "
"link or contact a number. They try to obtain the verification code they "
"requested, or simply ask for it in another message."
msgstr "不法之徒會向您發出訊息，訛稱您的帳戶有違規行為或存在風險，並傳送偽造的客戶服務連結，或同黨的電話號碼，以套取由他們發出請求的驗證碼，或再次向您發出訊息索取。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:26
msgid ""
"They attempt to log in to your account with your phone number and the "
"verification code on their own device."
msgstr "然後，騙徒會在自己的裝置輸入您的電話號碼和驗證碼，試圖登入您的帳戶。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:27
msgid ""
"They may ask you to confirm their login attempt as genuine, giving them "
"full access to your account."
msgstr "最後，騙徒會要求您認證他們的登入，從而騎劫您的帳戶。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:28
msgid ""
"Once hijacked, fraudsters send messages to your contacts asking for "
"money. Since the messages come from a trusted account, recipients often "
"comply."
msgstr "成功騎劫帳戶後，騙徒會向您通訊錄上的親友以不同原因索取金錢，親友會誤以為訊息來自可靠的帳戶（您的帳戶），繼而墜入金錢騙局。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:33
msgid "How to avoid your accounts being hijacked"
msgstr "如何防止帳戶被盜用"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:35
msgid "Strengthen your security settings:"
msgstr "加強保安設定"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:35
msgid ""
"Enable two-factor authentication (2FA) on WhatsApp, Instagram, and other "
"apps. Never share your PIN or one-time password with anyone."
msgstr "在WhatsApp、IG或其他通訊軟件開啟雙重驗證（2FA）功能後，用戶就需要兩個驗證步驟才能登入，大大加強賬戶安全"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:36
msgid "Protect your sensitive information:"
msgstr "小心保護敏感個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:36
msgid ""
"Never share digital banking credentials, PINs, or one-time passwords. "
"Stay vigilant even when chatting with people you know, as their accounts "
"may have been hijacked."
msgstr "切勿透露自己的敏感個人資料，包括網上理財登入資料、PIN碼或一次性密碼。若騙徒取得相關資料，您就有可能蒙受金錢損失"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:37
msgid "Beware of suspicious links and attachments:"
msgstr "避免點擊可疑的連結或附件"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:37
msgid ""
"Don’t click on suspicious links or download attachments, even if sent by "
"someone you know. Always check the source."
msgstr "不要隨意點擊訊息中的連結或下載附件，就算訊息是由熟人發出，您都應在點擊前仔細查清楚連結是否安全可靠。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:38
msgid "Learn about your apps and keep them updated:"
msgstr "多了解您使用的通訊軟件並定期更新"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:38
msgid ""
"Know your apps’ official policies (e.g., WhatsApp will never ask you to "
"download other apps, tap links, pay for service, or forward messages). "
"Use app security checkup features and keep apps updated."
msgstr "應確保自己對使用中的通訊軟件有足夠了解。以WhatsApp安全風險為例，官方網站表明絕不會要求用戶下載額外軟件或系統、點擊連結以前往另一網站或啟動新服"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:39
msgid "Verify through phone call:"
msgstr "致電親友查證"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:39
msgid ""
"If you receive a message from family or friends asking for financial "
"help, always call to confirm before sending money. If the bank account "
"holder’s name looks wrong, be extra careful. Use the Hong Kong Police "
"Force’s Scameter or Scameter+ to verify suspicious details."
msgstr "當收到親友訊息，要求您提供任何形式的經濟援助時，應先打電話給他們問清楚。如果銀行戶口持有人姓名不尋常，就要格外留神，切勿輕易轉賬給對方"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:44
msgid "Be aware – whatever, whenever and wherever"
msgstr "時刻提高警覺"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:45
msgid ""
"Stay vigilant at all times to protect yourself and help fight fraud. If "
"in doubt, call the police’s Anti-Deception Coordination Centre (ADCC) "
"hotline at"
msgstr "任何時候都應小心提防騙子，識破詐騙保障自己。如有懷疑，可致電警方的反詐騙協調中心"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:45
msgid "18222"
msgstr "「防騙易18222」熱綫。"

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:46
msgid ""
"HSBC is committed to protecting your financial security. If you think "
"you’ve encountered a WhatsApp or Instagram scam, contact HSBC:"
msgstr "滙豐致力保障您的財務安全。懷疑自己遭遇WhatsApp騙案或Instagram騙案？請即聯絡我們："

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:48
msgid "HSBC Global Private Banking:"
msgstr "滙豐環球私人銀行客戶："

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:49
msgid "HSBC Premier Elite:"
msgstr "滙豐卓越理財尊尚客戶："

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:50
msgid "HSBC Premier:"
msgstr "滙豐卓越理財客戶："

#: frontend/templates/instant-messaging-app-scams.html:51
msgid "Other personal banking:"
msgstr "其他個人理財客戶："

